 to commit suicide' R (recorded) and S (solved), and 'Attempted Homicide' R and S. The Recorded homicide figures are the same 2023 counts as dist2023 (total 573) but with the report's own division spellings (e.g. Kabethigollawa, Mulative, Seetawaka); both are kept as published. Division rows and province subtotals each sum to the FULL TOTAL row (573 recorded / 526 solved; 165 / 147 attempted). Province headings printed 'Southen', 'Northen', 'Uwa' were read as Southern, Northern, Uva. Police provinces (Senior DIG areas) are matched to the administrative provinces of the same name in geoBoundaries; they broadly follow the administrative provinces, but some police divisions may not line up exactly with provincial borders (e.g. Kantale division is grouped under Eastern), so treat the province shapes as approximate. The TID row is blank in this report and is not included."}},"dict":{"b":["Recorded","Solved","Total"],"m":["Homicide / abetment to commit suicide (grave crime)","Attempted homicide (grave crime)","Murder (grave crime recorded by police; Penal Code s.296,297)","Attempt to murder / abetment to commit suicide (grave crime recorded by police)"],"u":["count"],"s":["q4_2023","dist2022","dist2023"],"c":["2023","2022"]},"problems":"The first pass failed because the old police.lk/wp-content/uploads/2024 PDFs return 404 after the site redesign; the same tables were re-posted under /wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ and are linked from https://police.lk/statistics/. Only 2022 and 2023 division tables are posted there now. web.archive.org is still unreachable (shell and WebFetch), so earlier years could not be recovered.","unmatched":1,"shapes":{"shapes_ADM1.geojson":{"source":"geoBoundaries gbOpen LKA ADM1","url":"https://media.githubusercontent.com/media/wmgeolab/geoBoundaries/9469f09/releaseData/gbOpen/LKA/ADM1/geoBoundaries-LKA-ADM1_simplified.geojson","licence":"CC BY 4.0"}}}